WEBVTT

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.580
<b>Ole! Ramen</b>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:20.830
<b>Hijiriya Hitori</b>

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.000
<b>Ole! Ramen</b>

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:27.710
Here's your ramen!

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.090
Wow!

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:30.000
Looks delicious!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.670
Let's eat!

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:39.140
Yes!

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:43.480
Hey, I've been thinking...

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.560
Yes?

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:46.520
Christmas Eve is coming.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.770
How about we hold a Chri-pa?

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:50.780
A Chri-pa?!

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:52.330
What's going on?

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.950
En-chan, you're usually the one 
that hates that stuff the most...

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:58.910
Well, I was thinking it's important 
to engage with the 'mas.

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:00.120
Oh, I get it!

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:03.550
En-chan-senpai is bursting 
with Christmas spirit!

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:05.090
I'm so in!

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:07.430
And we'll have the party at 
Kurotama Bath, of course!

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:08.920
A Chri-pa with a hot bath, huh?

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:11.240
Okay, let's do it.

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:12.380
Yeah!

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.470
I'm looking forward to it <i>so much</i>!

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:18.360
Now, we just have to figure out the food...

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:20.720
We've got you!

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:25.020
Ole! Christmas Ramen?

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:26.350
Wow...

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:28.960
This shop's finally gone down 
the Christmas hole too, huh?

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:31.020
Opportunism is a fundamental 
part of doing business.

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:33.780
This sounds good to me.

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:35.670
Got it!

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:39.910
Mister, we want a Christmas 
ramen delivery on Christmas Eve!

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:42.270
Send it to the Kurotama Bath!

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:43.620
Okay!

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:47.080
Ole! I'm back.

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:49.040
Huh? Hijiriya-kun?

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:50.670
Hey...

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:51.720
I see!

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:53.640
Is this where you live?

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:54.660
You know him?

00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:56.840
He's my classmate, Hijiriya-kun!

00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:59.620
Bro Gora!

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:02.810
Oh, welcome back, Yumoto.

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:06.700
Hey, can we have a Chri-pa 
here on Christmas Eve?

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:07.660
A Chri-pa?

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.520
It means "Christmas party"!

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:11.740
We're going to gather at Kurotama Bath

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:12.800
and have cake

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:14.340
and get ramen delivered

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:16.570
and exchange presents!

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:18.490
Of course, you're invited too!

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:21.530
So can we reserve the bath for Christmas Eve?

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:23.750
Me and Christmas cake...

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:25.600
Me and ramen delivery...

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:27.450
Me and exchanging presents...

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:29.920
Yes, you can.

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:31.400
Yeah!

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:07.850
A Christmas of Love and Miracles

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:11.610
It's Christmas, huh?

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:12.310
Yeah...

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.120
Today's Christmas Eve!

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:29.130
You think Santa Claus 
will bring us a present?

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:32.120
I doubt it. He never does.

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:34.810
But don't worry!

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:38.750
He's our true Santa!

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.830
Yeah, he is!

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:42.780
We don't need Santa...

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:45.720
We don't need Christmas.

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:47.970
<b>Ole! Ramen</b>

00:04:51.010 --> 00:04:52.260
It's done.

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:54.440
<b>Merry Christmas</b>

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:59.360
<b>Ole! Ramen.</b>

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:58.850
Ole.

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:00.400
I'm off.

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:05.100
Wow, lame.

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:06.990
Hey, keep it down.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.920
Hey there, Red-Nosed Reindeer.

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:19.120
The day you fear and hate most 
in the whole year has arrived.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:20.250
Christmas Eve!

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:22.460
Wh-Who are you two?

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:25.090
16 years without a girlfriend.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:27.090
And no friends who like to throw parties.

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:29.680
So you spend every Christmas Eve

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:33.770
doing nothing but delivering 
ramen for your father.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:38.360
And every year hence, forever and ever...

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:41.460
Stewing in hatred and resentment 
of people happier than you...

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:43.950
That's how you'll spend this day.

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:47.640
Wouldn't you just love...

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:49.560
...to get rid of this day?

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:52.110
I hate Christmas...

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:53.920
I hate Christmas...

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:56.200
I wish it would just go away!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.340
Then why don't we grant...

00:05:58.340 --> 00:05:59.310
...that wish of yours?

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:01.130
Huh? How?

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:11.040
Now we just wait for him to do the rest.

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:12.890
We just have to wait...

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:15.850
...for the moment Christmas dies.

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:20.960
G-Gora-san!

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:22.730
Hello there, neighbors.

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:25.390
Sorry to surprise you from the rooftop.

00:06:25.390 --> 00:06:29.200
Yumoto is holding a Christmas party 
today, so I'm hanging decorations.

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:31.940
Oh, really?

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:33.660
Well, what about you two?

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:35.030
Would you like to join us?

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.420
<i>We were invited!</i>

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:44.250
<i>We were invited!</i>

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:45.960
<i>We were invited!</i>

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:47.710
<i>We were invited!</i>

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:49.510
<i>We were invited!</i>

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.300
<i>We were invited!</i>

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.260
<i>What to do?</i>

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:53.140
<i>What to do?</i>

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:53.930
<i>What to do?</i>

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:55.010
<i>What to do?</i>

00:06:55.010 --> 00:07:00.980
<i>Invited by the Santa Claus we've longed for!</i>

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:03.940
Come along and have dinner!

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:07.380
I finished the Christmas gyoza!

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.170
Sorry, Dadacha.

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:11.220
We're going...

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:12.950
...to the Chri-pa across the way!

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:15.840
Later!

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:17.580
Wait!

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:19.540
What about the monster?

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:23.710
That's right!

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.410
What do we do?!

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:27.880
After we finally got invited...

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:30.130
After we finally get to join the ranks 
of people satisfied living in reality...

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:32.130
At this rate, Christmas...

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:34.090
And all people living in 
reality across the world...

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:36.560
...are going to be destroyed!

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:38.490
That's right! So—

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:39.730
Hey, Dadacha!

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:42.020
Where's that monster right now?

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:42.830
Find him!

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:44.270
And tell him!

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:45.230
The plot...

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.190
...to destroy Christmas 
all across the world...

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:48.630
...is off!

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:53.420
Well, I think everything's in order.

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:55.220
Let's have a toast.

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:56.570
Okay!

00:07:56.570 --> 00:08:00.630
By the way, today we're having 
"Having a Christmas Toast With You

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:03.290
Love Shower Drink."

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:06.070
What's with that oh-so-conspicuous 
introduction?

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:09.380
This is what we always 
toast with at celebrations

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:12.510
on *#^$, where I was born.''

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.120
Excuse us!

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:15.000
Huh?

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:16.260
Who could that be?

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:18.800
Were you selling tickets to the party?

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:20.350
No!

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:21.730
Hello there!

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.200
Oh, you two.

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:24.480
The Beppu Brothers?

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:25.690
It is!

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:27.210
It's Brothers-senpai!

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:28.760
What are you doing here?

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:30.150
Oh, well, I...

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:31.550
Oh, Gora-san!

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:33.320
Thank you very much...

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:34.870
...for inviting us!

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:38.530
What are super idols doing 
here on Christmas Eve?

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:40.190
It is curious.

00:08:40.190 --> 00:08:43.240
You'd think they would have had other plans.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:46.500
You can't invite the Beppus just like that.

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:49.630
They're serious idols at our school.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:50.500
For now.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:51.900
For now?!

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:54.100
I'm sorry, I didn't realize...

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:56.360
Oh, don't worry about it!

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:58.590
We did have plans, but...

00:08:58.590 --> 00:09:00.100
We canceled them!

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:04.820
So you say. But I bet you really 
had nothing better to do.

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:07.850
So, Brothers-senpai!

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:10.680
Why don't you join us in a toast 
with our Love Shower Drink?

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:12.790
Here!

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:14.620
Yes! Thank you!

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:16.810
Well, Brothers-senpai!

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:17.990
Please sit here!

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:20.660
Have a seat here.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:22.200
Thank you!

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:27.210
Good thing I printed a 
few extra just in case.

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:29.270
Here, you can have some.

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:30.520
Chri-pa...

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:32.210
...schedule?

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:35.000
Okay, let's get started.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.170
Merry...

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:37.720
Christmas!

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:41.830
Brothers-senpai, thank you for joining us!

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:43.510
Cheers!

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:47.550
Gora-san! Cheers!

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:48.900
Yeah, cheers!

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:50.790
Huh?

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:58.530
The cake and the Love Shower 
Drink are both super delicious!

00:09:58.530 --> 00:09:59.750
Oh, Yumoto.

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:02.270
You got some cream on you.

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:03.200
Oh, bro!

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.460
Thank you!

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:12.100
Hey, Beppu-kuns.

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.570
You got cream on you.

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:16.320
What?

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:17.760
Did I do something wrong?

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:21.390
Brothers-senpai, feel 
free to eat all you like!

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:23.640
Here you are.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:24.260
Yes!

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.120
Thank you!

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:29.760
Speaking of eating, where's 
the Christmas ramen?

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:32.440
We ordered it for 7:00...

00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:35.960
I hope Dadacha's handling it...

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:37.250
Don't worry.

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:38.620
Nothing will happen.

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:40.410
We can't let it happen...

00:10:40.850 --> 00:10:43.910
At least, not until we get his present!

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:48.960
<b>Galaxy Idols
VEPPer
Most popular songs: 
 You Are a Distant First-Magnitude Star
*Star*The*VEPPer*</b>

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:54.610
Senpai, if the ramen's not coming, 
we should exchange presents first!

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:56.130
I can't wait!

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:58.300
What a great idea!

00:10:58.300 --> 00:10:59.590
Let's do it!

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:02.780
Guess we'll have to.

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:07.400
Swapping ramen smile time and 
present exchange time, huh?

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:10.480
But exchanging presents

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:12.650
is the highlight of the Chri-pa.

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:15.680
You gotta save the best 
part for the end, right?

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:17.510
He's right.

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:22.050
Well, let's swap it with the 
Christmas song sing-a-long instead.

00:11:22.050 --> 00:11:23.860
Yeah! Good idea!

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:25.920
Okay...

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:36.840
No good?

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:38.800
Monster...

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:41.010
is coming to town?

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:46.010
Is something wrong?

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.740
R-Rather than the sing-a-long...

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:51.350
I think Yumoto-kun's right...

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:53.940
We should exchange presents first!

00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:56.300
Now, quickly!

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:57.610
Before he comes!

00:11:58.300 --> 00:11:59.290
Who?

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:01.680
Oh... nothing...

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:03.210
We don't have a choice.

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:06.800
If they want it that badly, maybe 
doing that first will calm them down.

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:07.620
All right!

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:08.580
Yes!

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:12.080
There's something strange about those two.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:16.710
I wonder if Christmas 
makes them a little crazy.

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:20.090
Okay, let's get started.

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:22.340
I'm so excited!

00:12:22.560 --> 00:12:24.010
<i>The only present we want...</i>

00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:26.240
<i>is that one!</i>

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:29.920
Well, then. Christmas present exchange.

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:31.780
Let's start the music.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:34.850
Th-That sound...

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:37.230
Now?!

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:41.520
Even on Christmas Eve, we labor and toil.

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:44.320
I come on behalf of all those 
forced to work without rest...

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:45.490
Ole!

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:48.990
I am Red-Nosed Reindeer Monster!

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.820
Reindeer Monster?

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:52.700
What's he doing here now?

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.740
Hey, what do we do?

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:01.300
We definitely can't transform here...

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:04.370
I wish these monsters could 
time their appearances better.

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:05.530
Seriously!

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:06.640
What do we do?

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:09.730
Since there are people here right now,

00:13:09.730 --> 00:13:12.780
you'll just have to transform outside.

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:14.310
Hey!

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:17.310
Are you guys ignoring me?

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:19.530
It really is a reindeer!

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:22.900
Huh?

00:13:24.840 --> 00:13:26.130
Here, have some.

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:27.750
Oh...

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:29.280
Thanks?

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:30.900
Oh, dear...

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:31.940
What do we do?

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:33.950
There's only one thing <i>to</i> do.

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:36.960
We'll have to let them beat him!

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:40.560
But how do we get out of here?

00:13:40.560 --> 00:13:42.700
We could all say we gotta pee!

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:45.370
It would seem unnatural for us 
all to do that at the same time.

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:46.970
What about brushing our teeth, then?

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:48.570
Even more unnatural!

00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:49.570
That's it!

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:53.330
You all just had cake...

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:54.880
So why don't you go over there...

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:56.640
...and brush your teeth?

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:57.730
Huh?

00:13:57.730 --> 00:14:00.920
That might let us all brush our 
teeth in the most natural way!

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:03.570
Then take the invitation 
and get going already!

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:05.190
Hold on a minute!

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:10.320
You want to shove all the work 
on me and run off, do you?

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:15.040
I won't let you have all the fun 
on Christmas Eve without me!

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.450
No, it's not like that!

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:19.170
Oh, yes it is!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.250
Stupid Christmas Eve!

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:23.410
Stupid Christmas parties!

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:27.590
You get to have fun toasts and 
eat cake and exchange presents...

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:29.430
and gaze at each other 
in a nice restaurant

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:32.550
with a beautiful night view and 
a champagne glass in one hand...

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:35.330
Then you flash the girl your hotel room keys

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:37.120
and say "I got us a room"

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:40.460
and then go up in the elevator together

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:42.860
and then... and then...

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:44.480
So lucky!!

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:47.310
What is that reindeer talking about?

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:48.500
No idea.

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:51.390
Well, it's a reindeer-eat-reindeer 
world out there.

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:53.350
He probably has a lot of troubles.

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:56.540
Wait, are reindeer carnivores or herbivores?

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.870
We're omnivores with a 
strong herbivorous bent!

00:14:59.090 --> 00:15:00.750
But that's not the point!

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.370
I'm trying to tell you that

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:04.830
while you're happily 
enjoying yourselves here,

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:07.710
there are people out there working 
their antlers off! You hear me?

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:11.550
On Christmas, all the 
reindeer in the world...

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:12.510
Yes!

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:15.420
The reindeer bring presents 
to people all over the world!

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:18.100
You truly do magnificent work.

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:19.920
Want another drink?

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:23.760
I'll bring it to you.

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:26.230
Well, don't trouble yourself...

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:31.250
I know!

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:35.480
Why don't we close our eyes for no reason?

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:37.240
What a good idea!

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:39.500
Huh?

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:42.830
Those guys just started 
meditating or something...

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:44.340
That's weird.

00:15:44.340 --> 00:15:47.010
But that gives us our chance to transform!

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:48.420
<b>That's right!</b>

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:48.630
That's right!

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.920
<b>Time to Love Making!!</b>

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:50.920
Time to Love Making!

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:54.620
Love Making!

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:57.360
Hey, you twins!

00:15:57.800 --> 00:16:02.600
Are you trying to close your eyes to the 
fact that I'm working on Christmas Eve?

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:04.380
Oh...

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:05.560
Drat.

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:07.020
We almost had it!

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:09.020
I'm sorry for the wait.

00:16:09.020 --> 00:16:09.670
Take one.

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:11.740
Th-Thanks...

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:13.220
Darn it.

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:16.980
We managed to create our 
most annoying monster yet.

00:16:16.980 --> 00:16:20.450
But unless the Defense Club beats him...

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:22.860
We won't be able to exchange presents!

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:25.130
Oh, what's with this feeling 
of unrealized anticipation?!

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:27.940
I wanna exchange presents already!

00:16:27.940 --> 00:16:30.880
Then we need to defeat the monster first!

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:35.300
Let's brainstorm ideas for how 
you can leave and transform!

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:36.660
I know.

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:38.880
What if one of us pretends 
to have stomach pain,

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:40.810
and the others take him to the hospital?

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.770
Great idea! I'll play the sick one.

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:47.730
But I doubt the twins will buy it...

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:50.320
We'll just have to try it!

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:52.490
Action, I say!

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:55.210
Oh, how awful!

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:56.220
It hurts!

00:16:56.220 --> 00:16:58.210
My stomach does hurt so much!

00:16:59.680 --> 00:17:00.900
Yumoto!!!

00:17:00.900 --> 00:17:02.160
Are you okay?!?

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:03.770
What is this?

00:17:03.770 --> 00:17:06.520
Yumoto-kun, your stomach hurts, you say?

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:08.170
That is truly awful!

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:09.840
You must take him to the 
hospital immediately!

00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:12.010
They bought it?

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:12.840
Are you kidding me?

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:14.100
Come on, everyone!

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:15.300
This way!

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:16.920
Wait, Yumoto!

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:21.320
I made your big brother's 
special tummy tonic.

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:24.210
I know, but I need to go to the hospital...

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:24.980
Yumoto.

00:17:25.180 --> 00:17:26.690
Ah!

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:28.650
Ah...

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.080
I wish he'd butt out.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:33.470
No kidding.

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:35.650
Hey, you guys!

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:40.370
What kind of stupid fake 
performance was that?

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:43.620
Well, it's all your fault, Mr. Reindeer!

00:17:44.020 --> 00:17:46.330
You're ruining our Chri-pa!

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:47.540
That's right!

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:50.920
After so long, we got invited to a Chri-pa...

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:52.420
With that man...

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:53.760
...we've always admired!

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:56.520
Um, the point is...

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:59.510
Because of you, a dream we've 
held since childhood...

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:00.720
Is down the drain!

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:03.190
H-How could you...

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:07.390
You're telling me all you care about 
is whether <i>you</i> get to have fun?

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:10.350
Isn't it that selfish attitude

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:14.400
that has turned Christmas 
Eve into the circus it is?

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:15.360
Listen.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:18.360
Your happiness always comes 
on the back of someone else.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:18.360
Oh boy, they got him going again.

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:21.270
Behind all the fun you're having,

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:24.330
there's always someone working their 
fingers to the bone and crying!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:28.240
You could never understand the 
suffering and sorrow we go through!

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:29.290
Huh?

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:32.630
And yet no one ever stops to thank you.

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:35.630
They just complain that you're 
late, that the food is cold...

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:38.740
What do I even do it for?

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:41.260
You know, I... I...

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:43.430
I want a Chri-pa, too!

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:45.100
Then have one!

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:46.850
You can join us, Mr. Reindeer.

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:52.240
When things get bad, you 
should try to join in the fun!

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:54.980
I can... join in the fun?

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:55.730
Yeah.

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:59.200
You can have a fun Chri-pa with us!

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:01.230
Me, at a Chri-pa?

00:19:01.230 --> 00:19:03.340
Me, having fun?

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:06.120
Come along.

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:08.080
So nice!

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:11.790
Thank you so much!

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:12.700
Ole!

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:14.250
I'll enjoy the Chri-pa!

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:16.090
That's the way!

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:22.500
It's time for the Chri-pa highlight 
you've all been waiting for,

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:24.640
the present exchange.

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:26.180
Yeah!

00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:29.620
At last!

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:30.810
Yes...

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:32.390
Now, everyone.

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:34.020
Fetch your presents.

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:35.480
Right!

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.940
Now, let us begin.

00:19:38.180 --> 00:19:40.190
Start the music!

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:53.370
Stop.

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:58.180
Ole!

00:19:58.180 --> 00:19:59.920
My first ever present...

00:20:02.650 --> 00:20:04.020
I see.

00:20:04.020 --> 00:20:05.180
I get it.

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:07.260
That's why he did it...

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:14.340
That was some Chri-pa.

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:15.820
Yeah, it was something.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:19.660
"Something" may be the 
only way to describe it.

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:23.130
I really had a ton of fun!

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:26.130
My brother was really happy, too!

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:29.160
By the way, what presents did you get?

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.430
I got this from Yumoto.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:35.000
Yeah, that's a Wom-san, 
made from Wom-san's fur!

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:40.090
This is the Christmas ramen that 
Reindeer Monster had with him.

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:43.300
Though the noodles have gotten soggy 
and soaked up all the broth...

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:45.030
I got that.

00:20:45.030 --> 00:20:46.680
Oh, that's from me!

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:49.600
It's a blizzard rose that never wilts!

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:52.610
Hey, anybody want this?

00:20:53.400 --> 00:20:55.560
What about you, Kinugawa-senpai?

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:57.230
I got this!

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.300
It's from the student council!

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:02.520
Yeah, they sent it to the 
Defense Club yesterday.

00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:04.850
Seeing the three of them 
dressed up like Santa...

00:21:04.850 --> 00:21:07.990
They must be having a good time over there.

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:09.200
Looks like it!

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:13.500
By the way, what about the Beppu Brothers?

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:15.960
This happiness, we must...

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:17.740
...share it between us.

00:21:18.610 --> 00:21:20.880
Because that's what Christmas is all about!

00:21:21.120 --> 00:21:21.840
Yes.

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:22.590
This is...

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:24.300
What we've longed for for so long...

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:27.420
Gora-san's warmth!

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:29.220
I got this!

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:32.560
It's a hand-knitted sweater 
from the Brothers!

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:33.930
It's nice and warm!

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:36.860
Hand-knitted? That's kind of stalker-ish.

00:21:36.860 --> 00:21:38.680
And there's a heart on it...

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:42.020
By the way, I was so busy playing the music,

00:21:42.020 --> 00:21:44.820
I forgot to join the game!

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:47.730
That's right. What happened to that monster?

00:21:47.730 --> 00:21:51.550
He got the candy-filled Christmas 
stocking from Kinugawa-senpai

00:21:51.550 --> 00:21:53.320
and left looking really happy.

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:58.120
I don't think we've ever let a monster 
get away without turning him back before.

00:21:58.430 --> 00:22:02.340
But I just couldn't bring myself 
to attack him like that!

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:04.130
He was having so much fun!

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:06.170
Well, that's all right.

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:08.360
Everyone's happy.

00:22:08.360 --> 00:22:09.840
And it's Christmas Eve.

00:22:09.840 --> 00:22:10.720
Yeah.

00:22:11.040 --> 00:22:14.590
I guess Christmas really 
does make people crazy.

00:22:14.590 --> 00:22:15.810
Yes!

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:18.660
It's a Christmas Eve miracle!

00:24:00.930 --> 00:24:05.860
Next Time

00:24:00.930 --> 00:24:05.860
Love is Like the Snow

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:03.920
Next time: Love is Like the Snow.

00:24:04.090 --> 00:24:06.720
Love Making!
